Takes advantage of a wounded foe to perform a killing strike.  This attack is an automatic critical hit that does [1.0%, 1.6%, 2.0%, 2.3%, 2.5% (TL1-5)] extra weapon damage for each % of life the target is below maximum.

(A victim with 30% remaining life (70% damaged) would take [170%, 215%, 242%, 260%, 275% (TL1-5)] weapon damage.)

If an enemy dies from this attack then two of your talent cooldowns are reduced by 2 turns and Execution's cooldown is reset.
